<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Total Recall</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 20)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast total recall</a>
</pre>
<p>Like word of recall, but it takes your followers home with you: you and 
everyone in the room who follows you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Follow</a>) are taken to your 
hometown, or the temple of Udgaard if you have none. Everyone goes to your 
home, not their own.
</p><p>The magic builds up for about half a minute first. Anyone who dies before it 
is done, or stands somewhere magic can't take them out of, stays behind. You 
must be standing. It is also found on staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Word of Recall</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Follow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Groups</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>